<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="ballot-head"><div class="bar"></div><div class="hairlines"></div></div>
<p class="eyebrow">Platform administration</p>
<h1>Platform sign-in</h1>
<p class="sub">This page is for the operator who hosts this instance for union locals — not any
local's election committee and not observers. A committee sign-in does not open it; only a
platform administrator account does. Platform administrators see aggregate counts and create
locals; they can never read a ballot or any local's member roster.</p>
<form method="post" action="/platform/auth" style="max-width:420px">
  <label for="pu">Username</label>
  <input id="pu" type="text" name="username" required autocomplete="username">
  <label for="pp">Password</label>
  <input id="pp" type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
  <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Sign in</button>
</form>
<p class="sub" style="margin-top:18px">Committee members looking for their local's elections
should <a href="/login">sign in here</a> instead. Lost all platform passwords? The operator can
rotate <span class="mono">PLATFORM_OWNER_KEY</span> on the server and create a replacement
account at <a href="/platform/setup">/platform/setup</a>.</p>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
